(34, 'Long-term', 'How is stroke screened for in sickle cell disease?', 'With a transcranial Doppler every year from 2 to 16 years.', 2),
(35, 'Long-term', 'What is the only cure of sickle cell disease?', 'A stem cell transplant.', 1),
